name the Price label and value never overlap, whatever the path
show-sell IDX
close-dialog
show-buy HS
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 900
expect-no-overlap LabelPriceText LabelPriceValue
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTabLimit
close-dialog
show-buy HS
expect-no-overlap LabelPriceText LabelPriceValue
# A label left on top of the value (e.g. by an older build) heals on the next update:
show-buy Oil
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 3
expect-no-overlap LabelPriceText LabelPriceValue
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 7
expect-no-overlap LabelPriceText LabelPriceValue
expect-text-is LabelPriceText Price:
cleanup:
close-dialog
